00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:12.531
So why how could that possibly be an action
that would improve what's going on in Cuba

00:02:12.531 --> 00:02:15.150
if what we want to do is help the Cuban people?

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:20.020
So let's look at the full clip and you'll
see that along with a long list of terrible

